          "sense_id": "nqm-form1-s2",
          "definition": "To take punitive revenge upon someone; to punish for an act.",
          "usage_conditions": "This is the punitive realization of disapproval, distinct from merely voicing objection; the object may be introduced with مِنْ or عَلَى/عَلَيْهِ.",
